# Runtime user data — must never be committed (this repo is public).
#  - links.json accrues real Kick->Minecraft username mappings.
#  - channels.json is rewritten at runtime by +join/+leave, so a tracked copy
#    would leak the bot's live channel roster. Seed config ships as
#    data/channels.example.json — copy it to data/channels.json on first setup.
data/links.json
data/channels.json
